---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import { SITE_DESCRIPTION, SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title={SITE_TITLE} description={SITE_DESCRIPTION} />
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<h1>你好，欢迎来到 {SITE_TITLE}</h1>
			<p>这里是Despro的个人主页！！！</p>
			<section aria-labelledby="intro-title">
				<h2 id="intro-title">关于我</h2>
				<p>听好了，所谓Desperation_Prof就是绝望专家，他见证了超高校级的绝望，是要独自面临失败主义和绥靖主义的斗士，的绝望应对专家参上！</p>
				<p><a href="/about">走近一点，了解更多 →</a></p>
			</section>
			<section aria-labelledby="projects-title">
				<h2 id="projects-title">项目作品</h2>
				<p>整理中，待上线</p>
			</section>
			<section aria-labelledby="posts-title">
				<h2 id="posts-title">文章与笔记</h2>
				<p>一些迷思以及笔记，无足挂齿，希望有所帮助</p>
				<p><a href="/blog">浏览全部文章 →</a></p>
			</section>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>
<style>
	section {
		margin-top: 2.5em;
	}
</style>
